Feature: TC_07_STAFF - SIM Amendments and History Tab E2E Regression Pack

  # --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  # Legacy  : "Regression Suite for SIM Amendments - History Tab" (BISSAGL-5444, AT-TC-01, tmslink BISSAGL-14998)
  # Rewritten 15-10-2026 in the StaffSteps vocabulary (the wording the MAPS features run with). One end-to-end
  # scenario, the same clicks in the same order as the legacy scenario; # SECTION markers show where each
  # legacy block starts.
  #
  # Purpose:
  #   Every SIM change on an application must leave an entry in the History tab:
  #     - SIM found area amended on a parcel
  #     - amended claimed area changed on a parcel
  #     - SIM indicator flipped on a parcel
  #     - SIM amendments submitted with a note
  #     - SIM scheme opted out and back in
  #   The scenario ends by reverting and re-submitting, so the herd is left as it was found.
  #
  # Test data (kept as literals, as in legacy):
  #   Herd G175C038, scheme year 2023, parcels G17202130 / G22814025 / G22813057. The legacy Background fetched a
  #   submitted herd from the database but the scenario overrode it with this herd: the test needs a herd with
  #   these specific SIM parcels, which no query expresses.
  #   Login agr4442 (BISS Co-ordination 1). Password: TD:Password from the TestData row of this test case.
  #
  # Step definitions: stepdefinitions.BISS.STAFF.StaffSteps
  # Author: Aniket Pathare | aniket.pathare@government.ie
  # --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  Background:
    Given the staff user is logged in to the BISS internal portal as "agr4442"

  @regression @staff @sim @history @e2e
  Scenario: AT-STAFF-SIM-HIST-E2E-01 - Staff performs SIM parcel amendments and verifies each one in the History tab

    # SECTION 1 : Open the submitted herd's SIM screen - AT-TC-01 (BISSAGL-14998)
    When the staff user has opened the SIM screen for herd "G175C038" for scheme year "2023"

    # SECTION 2 : Amend the SIM found area and check the history
    When the staff user amends SIM parcel "G17202130" with the following values
      | simFoundArea | 4 |
    Then the amendment should be recorded in the application history
    And the latest history entry should mention "SIM parcel G17202130 has been updated"

    # SECTION 3 : Amend the claimed area and check the history
    When the staff user opens the "SIM" screen
    And the staff user amends SIM parcel "G22814025" with the following values
      | amendedClaimedArea | 6 |
    Then the amendment should be recorded in the application history

    # SECTION 4 : Flip the SIM indicator and check the history
    When the staff user opens the "SIM" screen
    And the staff user toggles the SIM indicator on parcel "G22813057"
    Then the amendment should be recorded in the application history

    # SECTION 5 : Submit the SIM amendments, opt out of the SIM scheme, check the history
    When the staff user opens the "SIM" screen
    And the staff user submits the SIM amendments with note "Test 7678"
    And the staff user toggles the SIM scheme option
    Then the amendment should be recorded in the application history

    # SECTION 6 : Opt back in and check the history
    When the staff user opens the "SIM" screen
    And the staff user toggles the SIM scheme option
    Then the amendment should be recorded in the application history

    # SECTION 7 : Post-test reset - revert, put the SIM indicator back, submit
    When the staff user opens the "SIM" screen
    And the staff user reverts the SIM amendments
    And the staff user toggles the SIM indicator on parcel "G22813057"
    And the staff user submits the SIM amendments with note "Set for Test 7678"
    Then the SIM amendment should be saved
